@startuml agentic_loop_sequence
skinparam shadowing false
title AgenticRAGLoop.run_turn() — Critic (pre) and Self-Review (post)

actor       User
participant "AgentGuard\n+ BudgetTracker" as GD
participant "AgentMemory" as M
participant "Planner" as P
participant "Tools" as T
participant "Re-rank" as RR
participant "Ground" as G
participant "Critic" as C
participant "Generate" as GEN
participant "Self-Review" as REV

User -> GD : question
GD -> GD : redact PII
GD -> M : recent turns + cited IDs, past-resolution hints
GD -> P : plan(question, context)
note right of P : LLM plan, validated against the tool\nand filter allow-lists; invalid ⇒ heuristic\n(planner_fallback). 1 iteration ⇒ heuristic.

loop iteration ≤ max_iterations (budget checked before every tool / LLM call)
  P -> T : run open sub-goals
  T -> RR : candidates (retrieve, filtered_retrieve)
  RR --> G : top-k
  T --> G : lookup chunks (exact fetch, not re-ranked)
  note over G : redacted evidence pooled across iterations;\nground per sub-goal, merge, truncate ⇒ allow-list
  G -> C : grounded context
  alt nothing grounded
    C --> P : insufficient (no LLM call)
  else insufficient
    C --> P : missing sub-goals + refine hint
    P -> P : refine (broaden / re-query; repeats skipped)
  else sufficient
    C -> GEN : grounded context
    GEN -> REV : draft
    alt passes (citations ⊆ allow-list, enough cited)
      REV -> GD : draft
      GD -> GD : Guardrails.process_answer(allow-list)
      GD --> User : answer + citations + loop summary
    else fails, revision budget left
      REV -> GEN : regenerate with reasons
    else fails again
      REV --> P : refine
    end
  end
end

opt budget exhausted or nothing left to try
  GD -> GEN : reserved call: best-effort draft over all grounded evidence
  GEN -> REV : draft (deterministic checks only)
  GD --> User : partial answer (gated) or standard refusal
end
GD -> M : save turn (+ resolution if allowed and cited); steps appended as they happen
@enduml
